flowchart TB
    VISITOR[Visitors, crawlers and other clients]

    subgraph DELIVERY[Delivered system]
        EDGE[Cloudflare edge and cached assets]
        WORKER[OpenNext Worker runtime]
        R2[R2 incremental cache]
        QUEUE[Cloudflare Queue]
        EXTERNAL[The Ground and Google Sheets]
    end

    subgraph EVIDENCE[Evidence layers]
        ZONE_ANALYTICS[Zone analytics<br/>Requests, HTML page views, bytes and cache]
        WORKER_ANALYTICS[Runtime analytics<br/>Invocations and CPU]
        RATE_CARD[Public rate cards<br/>Allowance comparison]
        ACCOUNT_BILLING[Authenticated account billing<br/>Zero usage charge in complete cycle]
        DOMAIN_INVOICE[Porkbun domain invoice<br/>US$11.08 first year]
        SEARCH_CONSOLE[Verified Search Console<br/>Clicks, impressions and indexing]
    end

    PORTFOLIO[Evidence-bounded portfolio claims]

    VISITOR --> EDGE
    EDGE --> WORKER
    WORKER <--> R2
    WORKER --> QUEUE
    WORKER --> EXTERNAL
    QUEUE --> EXTERNAL

    EDGE -.->|Aggregate delivery| ZONE_ANALYTICS
    WORKER -.->|Aggregate runtime| WORKER_ANALYTICS
    WORKER -.->|Observed usage| RATE_CARD
    R2 -.->|Observed usage| RATE_CARD
    QUEUE -.->|Usage position only| RATE_CARD

    ZONE_ANALYTICS --> PORTFOLIO
    WORKER_ANALYTICS --> PORTFOLIO
    RATE_CARD --> PORTFOLIO
    ACCOUNT_BILLING -->|Shared account, not project allocation| PORTFOLIO
    DOMAIN_INVOICE -->|Direct project cost| PORTFOLIO
    SEARCH_CONSOLE -.->|No verified property available| PORTFOLIO

    classDef observed fill:#eaf4e1,stroke:#48633c,color:#20301b
